ink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.012148585123052816,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":79.8,"_gate_insider_own":0.8754,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":100.0,"_gate_insider_buying":1.0,"_gp_insider_buying":true,"_score_insider_buying":100.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"Exzeo Group, Inc. provides turnkey insurance technology and operations solutions to insurance carriers and agents in the United States. The company offers Exzeo Platform, an Insurance-as-a-Service (IaaS) platform that provides technology-based solutions for operational and administrative activities, such as quoting and underwriting, policy management, claims management, data reporting, and financial reporting; and streamlines and automates interactions between insurance carriers and policyholders. It also provides CasaClue, a data repository; Harmony, a policy administration platform that streamlines the entire policy lifecycle; AtlasViewer, a mapping and data visualization platform that integrates location-based data from multiple sources; and Mercury, a workflow solution designed to ensure uniform routing and policy change tracking. In addition, the company offers ClaimColony, an End-to-end claims management platform; AtlasViewer, a tool to look at claims and manage the claims lifecycle; JustEZ app which helps sync inspections from various carriers, schedule appointments, sync photos to cloud, and write scoping reports; Exahub, a centralized data platform; and ExzeoIQ that provides transparent reporting for customers. The company was formerly known as TypTap Insurance Group, Inc. Exzeo Group, Inc. was founded in 2012 and is based in Tampa, Florida. Exzeo Group, Inc. is a subsidiary of HCI Group, Inc.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Pareshbhai Suryakant Patel | CEO & Chairman | Age 62 | Compensation: $4.2M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 354 people. Revenue per employee of $613K ranks in the above the sector median among Financial Services peers. Each employee generates $275K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $7K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 7\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (7/10).","financial_summary":["Exzeo Group, Inc. is a small-cap financial services business with a $1.5B market cap on $217M of annual revenue.","Gross margins of 60% are the starting point for assessing pricing power.","The business throws off $97M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 45 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.21\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.1%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 88% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and within its sector the business captures 1.9\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Very elevated short interest (15.2% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 20% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Shares offer a 19% margin of safety against estimated fair value","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Exzeo Group Inc (XZO) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Strong Margins and AI Platform Growth ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/exzeo-group-inc-xzo-q3-071557572.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793862957.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.45,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Exzeo (XZO) Q3 Earnings and Revenues Top Estimates","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3023632/exzeo-xzo-q3-earnings-and-revenues-top-estimates?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cyseop_template_4-3023632","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793835919.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.202,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Exzeo Group Inc (XZO) Q3 2026 Earnings Report Preview: What To Look For","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/exzeo-group-inc-xzo-q3-123946688.html","date":"2026-11-03","timestamp":1793709586.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.718,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Exzeo Group (NYSE:XZO) Shares Gap Up \u2013 Still a Buy?","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/10/16/exzeo-group-nysexzo-shares-gap-up-still-a-buy.html","date":"2026-10-16","timestamp":1792164886.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.838,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Exzeo Group, Inc. (NYSE:XZO) Stock Has Average Price Ta